{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261122/photo/bkn-20261122165148823-1122_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261122165148\"/><p>今晨(22日)10時59分，執法部門接獲一名姓黃(46歲)婦人報案，指其位於何文田京士柏山道的住所內，有兩枚分別價值約20萬及4.5萬港元的戒指，以及約2,000港元現金不翼而飛。經初步調查，案件列「盜竊」，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T09:04:02.592851+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T08:51:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T09:37:26.439228+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T08:57:26.181934+00:00","content_hash":"8d6d05360b84934e9e2d2fef56c8d34f67895caff8f378c2c6e309da4494f29f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}